    <string name="lan_pair">Connect to the computer (invite)</string>
    <string name="lan_pair_help">For 3 minutes the phone (“%1$s”) sends an invitation to computers with Velivo on the same Wi-Fi network. The computer asks “The phone … is asking to connect” – click “Yes”, then compare the 6-digit code on both screens and confirm. Real-time sync (LAN) must be on in the computer\'s Settings. Keep this window open and the screen on. If another computer asks, click “No” there. Connecting a phone doesn\'t change the sync between your computers.</string>
